WEBVTT

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:24.910
Don't take it personally.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:37.720
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:37.720
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.930
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibiku wa

00:00:37.720 --> 00:00:40.930
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:45.190
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:45.190
I want to tell you, but I can't.

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:49.190
Hatenai omoi ha anata...

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:49.190
I always long for you...

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.620
Boukansha no hibi ni yuuki wo dashitara sayonara

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:59.620
Say goodbye to the days of just being a bystander.

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:08.670
Demo "jiyuu" no teigi ni buranko no you ni yureteru no ne?

00:01:01.160 --> 00:01:08.670
But am I swaying over the meaning of "Freedom", like a swing?

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:13.800
Gosenfu ni kaita kaidan

00:01:09.340 --> 00:01:13.800
Stairs drawn on a music score,

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:17.300
Ippo susunde niho sagattemo

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:17.300
Even if I go down one step and back two steps,

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.310
Honno chotto setsunasa utau

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:21.310
The notes play a sad melody.

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:24.350
Watashi no real kanjite ne

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:24.350
Hear my reality!

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:28.270
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:28.270
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:31.820
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibikuwa

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:31.820
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:35.780
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:35.780
I want to tell you, but can't

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:39.200
Zutto anata wo sagashiteta

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:39.200
I've always been searching for you.

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:43.290
Tatoeba sou anataga hikari

00:01:39.820 --> 00:01:43.290
Let's say you are the light

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.750
Watashi ga kagede mitsume aetanara

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:46.750
And I'm the shadow, gazing at one other.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:50.790
Namida iro no diamond

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:50.790
The tear-colored diamond

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:54.590
Nee zero kara kagayakasetai

00:01:50.790 --> 00:01:54.590
I want to make it shine from nothing.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:02:00.140
Kowagaranaide musunde ne ai wo

00:01:54.590 --> 00:02:00.140
Don't be afraid of falling in love.

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:02.310
Deaiwo...

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:02.310
Nor of meeting people...

00:02:04.270 --> 00:02:09.400
The Migratory Bird

00:02:17.590 --> 00:02:19.160
I'm just like a migratory bird.

00:02:20.380 --> 00:02:22.380
Moving from one place to another because of my parents.

00:02:23.130 --> 00:02:25.800
I remember one or two of the schools I've been to,

00:02:25.800 --> 00:02:30.370
but if I tried to remember every school I've attended, my head would explode.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:36.710
I've tried my best not to get too involved with people just passing through my life.

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:42.860
Rather than all that, what's important is starting today.

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:49.080
Shiomi City, Tamatsu Island.

00:02:49.450 --> 00:02:52.830
I lived here for a short time about seven years ago.

00:02:58.130 --> 00:03:00.550
This is the first place I chose.

00:03:07.970 --> 00:03:11.930
Here, I will find the things I have yet to find.

00:03:21.650 --> 00:03:23.780
You must be Hasekura Kouhei-kun.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:38.710
I'm the Vice President of this school's student council, Sendo Erika.

00:03:39.090 --> 00:03:42.380
As a representative of the school, I warmly welcome you.

00:03:43.210 --> 00:03:45.510
Welcome to Shuchikan Academy!

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:53.560
Something I was missing...

00:03:56.270 --> 00:04:00.150
My new life will begin here.

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:01.880
Nice to-

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:14.080
A-Are you okay?

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:18.540
Y-Yes. I-It's nothing, so don't worry.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:20.750
But...

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:23.630
Really! It's fine. I'm all right.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:24.510
Vice Prez?

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.590
What are you doing?

00:04:27.680 --> 00:04:28.260
Who's this?

00:04:28.260 --> 00:04:29.930
Hachimandaira-kun!

00:04:29.930 --> 00:04:32.600
Perfect timing. He's a transfer student.

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:37.770
I have urgent business to attend to,
so could you give him a tour of the dormitory?

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:38.270
Huh?

00:04:38.270 --> 00:04:40.310
Great! You're a life saver!

00:04:40.310 --> 00:04:41.980
Thank you.

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:45.780
What? She said she welcomes me...

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:48.860
What is up with her?

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:54.370
Did you do something the moment you showed up, transfer student boy?

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:58.620
No, not that I can recall, current student boy.

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:01.210
You're a funny guy.

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:03.710
I'm Hachimandaira Tsukasa.

00:05:04.920 --> 00:05:07.340
Hasekura Kouhei. Fifth year.

00:05:10.970 --> 00:05:11.970
What's wrong?

00:05:11.970 --> 00:05:12.970
Nothing.

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:23.400
What is this?

00:05:23.400 --> 00:05:25.360
I've never felt anything like this.

00:05:26.440 --> 00:05:28.900
Hasekura Kouhei...

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:34.530
Oh. So you've been bouncing around from one school to another because of your dad's job.

00:05:34.530 --> 00:05:37.080
Yeah. But this school has full board, right?

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:39.460
So I finally don't have to worry about all of that.

00:05:40.370 --> 00:05:43.080
Though I must say the initial welcome was unique.

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:47.260
You made that fearless, "all-ahead-full" VP scream.

00:05:47.260 --> 00:05:53.220
You must have done something to her without realizing it;
if not, she seriously hated something about you.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:57.640
You're good at making people depressed, Hachimandaira.

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:58.640
Just call me Tsukasa.

00:05:58.640 --> 00:05:59.930
Here we are.

00:06:02.900 --> 00:06:05.610
This is the Hakuho Dormitory where we live.

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:06.690
Boys are on the first and second floors.

00:06:06.690 --> 00:06:08.150
Girls on the third and fourth floors.

00:06:08.940 --> 00:06:11.900
Don't step foot on a girls' floor even by mistake.

00:06:11.900 --> 00:06:15.830
If Sister Amaike finds you there, she won't hold back when whacking you with a frying pan.

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:18.620
What's wrong?

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:20.870
Sorry to intrude.

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:24.250
Huh? This is already your home.

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:28.840
Your room is 2A-18, right?

00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:30.170
Follow me.

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:37.390
Right. So this is my new home starting today.

00:06:37.890 --> 00:06:38.970
I kind of like that.

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.090
Salmon

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.090
chips

00:06:44.000 --> 00:06:46.090
Extra Salt

00:06:45.190 --> 00:06:46.110
Snack?

00:06:46.110 --> 00:06:47.690
Pick that up for me!

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:51.240
Kouhei!

00:06:51.240 --> 00:06:52.280
Onee-chan!

00:06:55.990 --> 00:06:57.990
Huh? Who are they?

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:02.790
Oh, they're people I met at my old schools.

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:04.960
I can't even remember their faces.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:09.460
What do you expect? That's how I've always interacted with them.

00:07:10.670 --> 00:07:13.510
Wait. That's...

00:07:13.510 --> 00:07:14.160
Hey!

00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:16.590
Wake up!

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:21.060
Wake up! You need to wake up! It's time to wake up!

00:07:21.060 --> 00:07:22.560
Get up!

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:23.310
Onee-chan.

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:25.190
He won't get up.

00:07:25.190 --> 00:07:26.020
Leaves me no choice.

00:07:26.020 --> 00:07:28.360
I wake him up with my Kanade Special!

00:07:28.360 --> 00:07:30.150
You can't kill him!

00:07:30.150 --> 00:07:33.530
Hey. You alive, Kouhei?

00:07:35.320 --> 00:07:36.280
Kouhei?

00:07:38.660 --> 00:07:40.240
It's Kouhei!

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:43.120
Look, Hina-chan! It's Kouhei! Kouhei!

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:47.540
Kanade... Hina...

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:52.340
Oh yeah. Those are their names.

00:07:54.550 --> 00:07:55.800
Yuki Haruna.

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:59.850
And her older sister, Kanade-san.

00:07:59.850 --> 00:08:01.720
Long time no see, Kouhei.

00:08:01.720 --> 00:08:06.230
Kouhei? As in, Hasekura Kouhei-kun?

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:09.900
Yup! The Kouhei we played with a lot when we were little.

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:12.230
Look how big you've grown!

00:08:12.230 --> 00:08:13.190
Well yeah...

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:15.240
Someone you know, RA?

00:08:15.650 --> 00:08:17.700
RA? You are?

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:21.330
Yup, and we're childhood friends, right, Kouhei?

00:08:21.740 --> 00:08:27.160
Y-Yeah. I lived here for a while, seven years ago.

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:28.250
I see...

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:31.290
So you're that Kouhei-kun.

00:08:32.210 --> 00:08:38.010
Lucky you. If you had forgotten about us, I would have wrapped you up in a futon and dropped you into the ocean.

00:08:38.720 --> 00:08:40.760
Please, anything but that.

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:44.430
Onee-chan. Don't you have something else to say to Kouhei-kun?

00:08:44.430 --> 00:08:46.180
Oh yeah.

00:08:46.770 --> 00:08:48.810
Sorry I knocked you down the stairs.

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:50.940
To make up for it...

00:08:51.650 --> 00:08:52.770
You can have this.

00:08:56.070 --> 00:08:56.900
Thank you.

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:07.460
So, what's it like?

00:09:07.910 --> 00:09:13.750
Unreal. It feels like something that can't be explained rationally is moving my body.

00:09:16.010 --> 00:09:18.010
Though, I don't intend to let it take control.

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:20.840
What are you talking about?

00:09:20.840 --> 00:09:25.770
I asked you about our new, merry friend who has joined the school, Vice Prez.

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:28.140
You sly raccoon.

00:09:29.560 --> 00:09:32.150
When did you see me with a belly drum?

00:09:32.650 --> 00:09:35.780
I know. Hasekura Kouhei, right?

00:09:36.150 --> 00:09:38.110
At the very least, he's...

00:09:41.280 --> 00:09:44.160
Not a merry friend to me.

00:09:45.620 --> 00:09:49.710
Then, Kouhei looked so scared.

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:54.460
Sounds like they're having fun upstairs.

00:09:54.880 --> 00:10:00.930
On the other hand, you're pretty unlucky to not have your things thanks to some routing mistake.

00:10:00.930 --> 00:10:04.760
If it weren't for you, I would have had to sleep on the floor.

00:10:05.550 --> 00:10:08.310
So, you think you'll be able to have fun here?

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:12.100
I'm not sure yet.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:24.320
But, I think I can find what I've been missing so far, at least.

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:46.800
That looks good.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:47.970
Yeah.

00:10:47.970 --> 00:10:49.600
Look, it's Kouhei!

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:53.420
Two boys eating alone? Pretty sad.

00:10:53.420 --> 00:10:56.460
Since I feel sorry for you, we'll join you here.

00:10:56.460 --> 00:10:59.170
Sorry about last night. Were we too loud?

00:10:59.170 --> 00:11:02.590
Yeah. My room's right above yours.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.560
I slept in Tsukasa's room.

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:07.390
You did? That's good then.

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.690
Yet, the voices still carried through the walls.

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:11.770
Hehe, sorry.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:14.400
We had a little too much fun last night.

00:11:14.400 --> 00:11:19.070
We often have tea parties, gathering friends we get along with.

00:11:19.070 --> 00:11:22.320
I know! Let's do it at Kouhei's place next!

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:25.080
I hope you'll take it easy on me when you do.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.460
So good!

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.630
Another fine job, Iron Chef!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:38.510
Iron Chef?

00:11:38.800 --> 00:11:43.340
The Student Council headhunted a famous chef from somewhere.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:46.680
Wow. The Student Council here must be pretty amazing.

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:51.310
And that VP's avoiding me?

00:11:51.310 --> 00:11:53.900
Hey, you look depressed, Kouhei.

00:11:53.900 --> 00:11:56.320
Okay, then let big sister give you a treat.

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:56.860
Shuuchikan

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:56.860
Academy's

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:56.860
secrets<i>!</i>

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:56.360
Secret

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:57.820
Shuuchikan

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:57.820
Academy's

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:57.820
secrets<i>!</i>

00:11:56.820 --> 00:11:57.820
Secret

00:11:58.820 --> 00:12:00.280
A school map?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:03.030
It's distributed to new students every year.

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.240
You see the route mapped out along with an explanation, right?

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:09.790
You are to follow the map and take pictures of all 108 places.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:12.160
You must complete it by the entrance ceremony!

00:12:15.630 --> 00:12:18.630
So, it's basically like an orientation?

00:12:19.000 --> 00:12:20.170
Let's see...

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:23.010
The gym.

00:12:23.930 --> 00:12:25.010
The lecture hall.

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:26.680
Water fountain.

00:12:30.390 --> 00:12:31.100
What?

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.020
Yukimaru!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.270
Yukimaru! You mustn't, Yukimaru!

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:37.110
It's time you go back in your cage.

00:12:46.490 --> 00:12:47.950
This is interesting.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:51.620
Got you.

00:12:53.500 --> 00:12:54.580
Yukimaru.

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:55.120
There.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.670
Thank you very much.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:01.710
Yukimaru because he's white as snow and round, huh?

00:13:01.710 --> 00:13:02.920
He's an energetic one, too.

00:13:02.920 --> 00:13:07.680
Yes. I wanted to give him a little exercise, but he got away from me.

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.430
You're really good at catching rabbits.

00:13:11.010 --> 00:13:12.640
Y-You think so?

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:14.430
By the way, why are you dressed like that?

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.440
This is the uniform of the Laurel Ring.

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:22.440
It's like a council group that helps maintain the chapel.

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:24.240
You haven't heard of it?

00:13:24.240 --> 00:13:25.200
Togi-san!

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.740
Did you capture Yukimaru?

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:30.200
Yes, Sister.

00:13:30.620 --> 00:13:33.580
Hi, this is a new face.

00:13:33.580 --> 00:13:35.960
I'm Hasekura Kouhei, a transfer student.

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.460
A transfer student?

00:13:38.130 --> 00:13:39.500
Oh, that's why.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:41.670
My name is Togi Shiro.

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:43.460
Nice to meet you.

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:47.380
I'm Amaike, working as a Sister here.

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:51.560
I'm also a counselor, so come see me if anything bothers you.

00:13:51.560 --> 00:13:52.810
Amaike...

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:55.930
Oh, the person who whacks people with a frying pan.

00:13:57.230 --> 00:13:59.440
Oh. Who did you hear that from?

00:13:59.440 --> 00:14:03.730
Oh, um... I'm in a bit of a hurry, so...

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:04.360
Excuse me!

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:05.740
Where are you off to?

00:14:06.820 --> 00:14:08.070
Uhh...

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:10.160
Directing Students Building?

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:11.870
Oh, if that's the case...

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:14.490
...this is the Directing Students Building.

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:18.500
Thank you for bringing me here.

00:14:18.960 --> 00:14:20.000
So...

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.540
Directing Students Building.

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:24.250
Building used by the Student Council.

00:14:24.250 --> 00:14:25.840
Also known as "The Devil's Lair".

00:14:26.380 --> 00:14:29.050
Let's get a picture and move on.

00:14:29.510 --> 00:14:30.470
You there.

00:14:30.930 --> 00:14:31.600
Yes?

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:33.810
Yes, you.

00:14:33.810 --> 00:14:37.270
What brings an ordinary student to the Directing Students Building?

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:38.770
Nii-sama.

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:40.650
Nii-sa...

00:14:41.100 --> 00:14:43.650
What are you to Shiro?

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:45.610
Ah... Um... Nothing...

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:47.820
He is a transfer student.

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:52.570
He caught Yukimaru for me, so I guided him here to repay him.

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:54.120
Transfer student?

00:14:55.490 --> 00:14:56.160
Okay.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:59.330
Shiro, you should go now.

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:01.080
Y-Yes.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:02.500
See you.

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:09.380
You, too. If you don't have any business here, you should leave.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.380
Otherwise-

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.890
Well, well!

00:15:11.890 --> 00:15:13.680
Isn't this a rare sight.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.760
Is he your guest, Sei?

00:15:16.560 --> 00:15:18.770
No. Just an ordinary student passing by.

00:15:19.600 --> 00:15:22.270
What a unique name. Ordinary Student-kun?

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:25.980
I-I'm Hasekura.

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:30.070
Hey, Iori.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.700
Can't you take a joke?

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.910
You're so uptight, Sei-chan.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:39.200
So, Hasekura-kun.

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:41.000
Would you like to stop by for tea?

00:15:42.420 --> 00:15:43.000
Huh?

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.340
The main entrance.

00:15:45.840 --> 00:15:47.050
The stairs.

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:49.670
What's with him?

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:55.640
I kind of understand why Kanade-san wrote "The Devil's Lair".

00:15:56.220 --> 00:16:00.600
And here we have the Directing Students Room, where the Student Council members gather.

00:16:03.850 --> 00:16:05.230
So who was the guest?

00:16:06.610 --> 00:16:08.480
Why are you here?!

00:16:08.480 --> 00:16:12.820
I thought we should enjoy a more lively tea time today.

00:16:12.820 --> 00:16:14.490
I invited him.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.990
You jerk!

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:19.950
What are you thinking, inviting him?!

00:16:19.950 --> 00:16:22.000
Were you not listening to me yesterday?!

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:24.920
Oh yeah. I just remembered.

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:27.540
Anyway, could you let go?

00:16:27.540 --> 00:16:29.420
You're being rude in front of a guest.

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:34.760
Fine. Then enjoy your time.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:42.810
I hope you don't take it personally.
As you see, my little sister has poor manners.

00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:43.810
Sister?

00:16:44.230 --> 00:16:44.850
She?

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:45.770
Then...

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:48.440
I'm Sendo Iori, a sixth year student.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:51.030
Erika's older brother as well as the keeper of this place.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.030
In other words, I'm the Student Council President.

00:16:53.400 --> 00:16:54.950
Student Council President?

00:16:55.450 --> 00:16:57.570
I'm Togi Seichiro, sixth year.

00:16:57.570 --> 00:16:59.280
Student Council Treasurer.

00:17:00.040 --> 00:17:03.160
You already know Erika, the VP, right?

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.540
Sort of.

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:07.580
Now that the introductions are over...

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.590
Hasekura-kun.

00:17:10.590 --> 00:17:12.920
Do you believe in love at first sight?

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.760
You see, Erika's very passive when it comes to love.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:20.060
Sorry, I don't really understand.

00:17:20.060 --> 00:17:21.680
You're pretty slow, aren't you?

00:17:21.680 --> 00:17:23.180
To spell it out for you...

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:28.560
It looks like Erika fell in love with you at first sight.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:30.400
L-Love?

00:17:31.730 --> 00:17:33.820
Don't tell her I told you this.

00:17:33.820 --> 00:17:38.820
Unlike Sei, she's not cute at all,
but I hope you get along well with her.

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:42.410
That's why I told you to leave.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.870
You're telling me to pretend I don't see my sister in agony?

00:17:44.870 --> 00:17:47.870
I have to fulfill my brotherly role at times like this.

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.790
Men

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.790
Women

00:17:51.460 --> 00:17:53.260
The VP has feelings for me.

00:17:54.880 --> 00:17:57.130
But, if I think about it that way...

00:17:59.050 --> 00:18:01.510
Wow, pretty big.

00:18:14.190 --> 00:18:18.030
No! I meant the bath is big!

00:18:18.030 --> 00:18:18.660
Wait, why...

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:22.530
Is this real?

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:25.250
Of course!

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:33.670
I hope he liked it.

00:18:33.670 --> 00:18:36.510
Cupid of love, Sendo Iori style.

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:39.880
Don't make her do the work.

00:18:39.880 --> 00:18:44.180
Also, fix the curtains before you cause more casualties.

00:18:44.180 --> 00:18:46.560
Can you do it for me, Sei-chan?

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:51.190
You have a wonderful maple leaf on your cheek, Kouhei.

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:53.110
You can say that because it's not on yours.

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:54.570
Very true.

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:56.820
I heard all about it!

00:18:57.490 --> 00:19:01.030
Is it true that you barged into the girls' bath buck naked, Kouhei?!

00:19:01.030 --> 00:19:02.240
Kanade-san?

00:19:02.240 --> 00:19:03.700
You heard really fast.

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:06.750
A delinquent like you gets punishment from the Disciplinary Committee!

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:10.500
A discipline sticker that makes crying babies cry more!

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:11.460
When you collect ten,

00:19:12.290 --> 00:19:14.210
you'll have a wonderful punishment waiting for you.

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.210
What a great start.

00:19:16.210 --> 00:19:18.760
So Kouhei-kun. Why?

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:22.390
When I went there, the curtains were reversed.

00:19:23.510 --> 00:19:24.680
I'm telling the truth!

00:19:24.680 --> 00:19:27.100
Oh. Now it makes sense.

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:32.810
Togi-senpai was talking with the Prez about "making her work" and about curtains.

00:19:33.270 --> 00:19:34.940
So it was his doing.

00:19:34.940 --> 00:19:38.030
Oh. I can see him doing it.

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:39.900
But what for?

00:19:39.900 --> 00:19:42.660
Rationality don't work against Iorin.

00:19:42.660 --> 00:19:45.780
He just likes playing pranks like that.

00:19:45.780 --> 00:19:46.830
Pranks?

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:51.120
Then that totally makes the Vice Prez a victim in this.

00:19:52.330 --> 00:19:55.420
A prank that doesn't make everyone laugh isn't fun.

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:56.340
Right?

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:58.090
Yeah, I guess.

00:19:58.920 --> 00:20:02.590
Whatever the circumstances might have been, I need to apologize to the Vice Prez.

00:20:06.300 --> 00:20:07.810
See you tomorrow.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:08.680
Yeah.

00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.020
Good night, Kouhei.

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:12.230
See ya, Heiji.

00:20:12.230 --> 00:20:14.850
"Heiji"? Is that me?

00:20:16.860 --> 00:20:20.490
Oh yeah. Your stuff arrived.

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:22.400
So I get my own room after only one night.

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:24.070
Finally something positive.

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:27.160
Well, well, if it isn't...

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:33.000
Um, Vice President, I...

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:37.040
Tomorrow at 5pm, come see me at the Hosaka Zelkova.

00:20:38.340 --> 00:20:40.050
I have something to tell you.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:44.050
The Hosaka Zelkova, eh? Nice.

00:20:45.010 --> 00:20:46.260
It's a hundred years old.

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:52.060
It's said the soul of a girl, who had an incurable illness, dwells in it and grants any wish.

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:54.520
It's now a popular spot to confess one's love at this school.

00:20:54.890 --> 00:20:55.810
Really?

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:02.780
I guess I'll finish this task from Kanade-san by five.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:06.200
But... love confession?

00:21:07.700 --> 00:21:09.740
No way.

00:21:22.050 --> 00:21:24.800
It's pretty dark in here.

00:21:25.550 --> 00:21:27.800
Let's get this done already.

00:21:33.680 --> 00:21:35.100
W-Who is it?!

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:30.410
I miss you

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:30.410
I miss you.

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:50.550
Mabushii kurai e ni kaita jikan nano

00:22:40.920 --> 00:22:50.550
Just like in a perfect painting,

00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:55.310
Sou ima ha...

00:22:50.550 --> 00:22:55.310
Now is a dazzling moment.

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:09.360
Kawari hajimeta machinami ni me wo sorashi

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:09.360
I look away from the city that's starting to change

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:15.080
Omoide ha tada iuno

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:15.080
And my memories whisper to me, saying,

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:22.210
Soko de tomadou dake

00:23:15.080 --> 00:23:22.210
You're only at a loss.

00:23:22.210 --> 00:23:24.170
I miss you

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:28.460
Omoi wo sono mama dakishimete

00:23:24.170 --> 00:23:28.460
Hold on to your feelings.

00:23:28.460 --> 00:23:30.380
I miss you

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:34.680
Kawaranu omoi wo shiritai no

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:34.680
I want to know how you've always felt.

00:23:34.680 --> 00:23:36.600
I miss you

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:40.350
Negatteru kara

00:23:36.600 --> 00:23:40.350
I'll always long for you, so...

00:23:40.890 --> 00:23:46.360
I miss you...

00:23:57.840 --> 00:23:59.790
I can't believe he stood me up!

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:00.760
That jerk!!!

00:24:06.040 --> 00:24:21.060
「Opening Ceremony」

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:21.060
Second Episode

00:24:07.190 --> 00:24:09.110
Lonely looking hands.

00:24:09.150 --> 00:24:11.360
Ice-cold looking fingertips.

00:24:11.400 --> 00:24:17.070
The warmth we feel from linked hands is the pulse of life.

00:24:17.110 --> 00:24:20.530
The first bond...
